[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17762.99, "timestamp": "04:56:02", "text": "我是吗？我的天哪。搞什么鬼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17766.51, "timestamp": "04:56:06", "text": "这里没有蝙蝠。这个人一无所有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17769.75, "timestamp": "04:56:09", "text": "蝙蝠。他身上有股臭味。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17772.55, "timestamp": "04:56:12", "text": "臭死了。该死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17774.15, "timestamp": "04:56:14", "text": "你知道这意味着什么吗，乔？如果你看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17775.83, "timestamp": "04:56:15", "text": "我的直播，《黑豹》，他们有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17778.868, "timestamp": "04:56:18", "text": "黑豹，老兄。嗯……这个问题，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17781.19, "timestamp": "04:56:21", "text": "老兄。上一轮我和他一起玩了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17782.628, "timestamp": "04:56:22", "text": "他什么乐器都不会，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17784.39, "timestamp": "04:56:24", "text": "治疗师。实际上，他是治疗师。他是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17785.99, "timestamp": "04:56:25", "text": "垃圾。他只会下黑棋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17787.83, "timestamp": "04:56:27", "text": "豹。那简直就是他的真身。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17790.23, "timestamp": "04:56:30", "text": "仅角色。他在各方面都表现得很糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17792.07, "timestamp": "04:56:32", "text": "其他角色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17796.31, "timestamp": "04:56:36", "text": "谢谢，但不用谢他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17798.23, "timestamp": "04:56:38", "text": "等等，那是人说话吗？哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17800.788, "timestamp": "04:56:40", "text": "等待。您已打开。是的。对，就是那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17802.47, "timestamp": "04:56:42", "text": "那是游戏里有人在说话。他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17804.708, "timestamp": "04:56:44", "text": "那场比赛我一次都没换到他身上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17806.07, "timestamp": "04:56:46", "text": "他简直就像在说：“嘿，我玩黑猫。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17808.39, "timestamp": "04:56:48", "text": "“黑豹。”就这样。等等，什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17812.39, "timestamp": "04:56:52", "text": "嘿，我玩黑豹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17815.19, "timestamp": "04:56:55", "text": "请大家投票给黑豹好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17818.948, "timestamp": "04:56:58", "text": "当然，兄弟。"}]